      "image": "form_15.png",
      "formula": "\\begin{eqnarray*} \\text{Chamfer Distance: } d_{CD}(X,Y) &=& \\frac{1}{|X|}\\sum_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) || + \\frac{1}{|Y|}\\sum_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) || \\\\{} \\text{Hausdorff distance: } d_H(X,Y) &=& \\max \\left\\{ \\max_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) ||, \\max_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) || \\right\\} \\\\{} \\text{Precision: } P(X,Y|d) &=& \\frac{100}{|X|} \\sum_{i \\in X} || x_i - n(x_i, Y) || < d \\\\{} \\text{Recall: } R(X,Y|d) &=& \\frac{100}{|Y|} \\sum_{i \\in Y} || y_i - n(y_i, X) || < d \\\\{} \\text{F-Score: } F(X,Y|d) &=& \\frac{2 P(X,Y|d) R(X,Y|d)}{P(X,Y|d) + R(X,Y|d)} \\end{eqnarray*}",
